00:44:23,360 --> 00:44:37,360
I think we are way too self-obsessed as an industry about sort of looking at us, how glorious we are, and then we go off. And I think a little bit of that, I think is what's not working, right?

425
00:44:37,520 --> 00:44:41,092
Because I think the real world wants to know a couple of things.

